   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till MR-Fondens verksamhet i Afrika och Latinamerika (samt med globala medel. Fonden st&#xf6;djer enskilda organisationer i Uganda, Nigeria, Kongo-Brazzaville, DRK, Kenya, Colombia, Equador, Peru, Haiti och de regionala MR-mekanisamerna.Prioriterade omr&#xe5;den &#xe4;r ESK-r&#xe4;ttigheter, kvinnors m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter &amp; r&#xe4;ttssamh&#xe4;llet.Programmet inkl PLUS ID 72601001, 72600699.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the activities of the Swedish NGO Foundation for Human Rights in Africa and Latin America (and with funds from Global). The Foundation supports NGOs in Uganda, Nigeria, Congo (Brazzaville), DRC, Kenya, Colomiba, Equador, Haiti and the regional HR mechanisms.Prioritised areas are ESC rights, women&apos;s human rights, and Rule of Law. Programme includes PLUS ID 72601001, 72600699.</narrative>
